    ARM: dts: qcom: msm8226: Describe the GPU IOMMU
    
    Describe the GPU SMMU global registers, user and privileged context banks,
    interface/bus/TBU clocks and OXILICX GDSC. Attach context zero to the GPU,
    matching the existing integration. Both nodes remain disabled by default.
    
    Refresh the existing implementation from dad2d15ff6ba
    onto the current Qualcomm ARM32 base, retaining the platform data.
    All eighteen current upstream boards inheriting this common description
    leave the GPU disabled; the future board enablement must enable its IOMMU.
    
    Original implementation by Timothy Schmidt, with Claude Opus 5.5
    assistance credited in the original commit. Refreshed with OpenAI Codex
    assistance. Human review and DCO certification remain pending.

